fields.value:
 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Vendetta icon0}}
| desc = Nyx Assassin becomes invisible and gains a speed bonus. If Nyx Assassin attacks to break the invisibility, massive bonus damage is dealt with the attack that applies a break to the target. Nyx Assassin has 75 additional attack range and a 70% faster attack animation for this attack.
}}
* Grants the following bonuses while active:
** Has {{#expr:{{Show|H|Nyx Assassin|atkrange}}+{{#var:Vendetta type1 value1}}}} {{M|attack range}}.
** Has {{Code|{{#expr:{{Show|H|Nyx Assassin|atkpoint}}*{{#var:Vendetta type1 value2}}}} + {{Show|H|Nyx Assassin|atkbacks}}}} attack animation time.

* {{Symbol|Ranged}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Attack Damage}} {{Symbol|Projectile|Impact}}
** For [[ranged]] heroes, the {{M|invisibility}} component breaks upon the attack {{M|projectile}} impact.
** Therefore, the {{M|spell damage}} bonus will not be applied if another action was queued before the projectile hits.

